---
/**
 * Privacy Policy — P31 Labs, Inc.
 * p31ca.org/privacy
 *
 * Zero-telemetry architecture. Local-first. No data collection.
 */
import AppShell from '../layouts/AppShell.astro';
---

<AppShell title="Privacy Policy — P31 Labs" description="Privacy policy for P31 Labs open-source assistive technology. Zero telemetry, local-first architecture.">
  <main class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6 py-16">
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold text-white mb-2">Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="text-sm text-gray-400 mb-8">Effective: June 10, 2026</p>

    <div class="space-y-8 text-gray-300 leading-relaxed">
      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white mb-3">1. Zero-Telemetry Architecture</h2>
        <p>All P31 Labs software — including PHOS, Willow, BONDING, and this technical hub — is designed to be <strong class="text-emerald-400">local-first and zero-telemetry</strong>. No personal data is sent to our servers. No analytics. No tracking. No third-party cookies. User data stays on the user's device, stored in local IndexedDB, PGLite, or service worker caches.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white mb-3">2. Information We Do Not Collect</h2>
        <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-2 ml-4">
          <li>Names, email addresses, or payment information</li>
          <li>Location data, IP addresses, or device identifiers</li>
          <li>Usage logs, interaction telemetry, or behavioral data</li>
          <li>Family chat messages, journal entries, or drawings</li>
          <li>Voice recordings or audio data</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white mb-3">3. Where Data Is Stored</h2>
        <p>All user-generated content — journal entries, voice memos, drawings, messages, mood logs — is stored locally on the device using IndexedDB, PGLite (embedded PostgreSQL), or the browser's cache. Synchronization between devices, where available, is user-initiated and encrypted end-to-end.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white mb-3">4. Children's Privacy (COPPA)</h2>
        <p>Willow and BONDING are designed for children under parental supervision. We do not knowingly collect personal information from children under 13. Parental consent is required before any local data logging. All data remains on the child's device and is never transmitted to P31 Labs or any third party.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white mb-3">5. Third-Party Services</h2>
        <p>We use no third-party analytics, advertising, or tracking services. Cloudflare is used for edge hosting and does not provide us with personally identifiable visitor data. Donations are processed by Stripe and Ko-fi — you should review their privacy policies for payment handling details.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white mb-3">6. Open-Source Transparency</h2>
        <p>All P31 Labs software is open-source under the MIT License. The complete source code is auditable on GitHub. We invite independent security researchers to verify our zero-telemetry claims.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white mb-3">7. Changes to This Policy</h2>
        <p>Any changes will be posted on this page with an updated effective date. Continued use of the Platform after changes constitutes acceptance of the revised policy.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white mb-3">8. Contact</h2>
        <p>Questions about this policy: <a href="mailto:will@p31ca.org" class="text-cyan-400 hover:underline">will@p31ca.org</a></p>
      </section>
    </div>

    <footer class="mt-12 pt-6 border-t border-gray-800 text-xs text-gray-500">
      <p>P31 Labs, Inc. — Georgia Domestic Nonprofit (EIN 42-1888158)</p>
    </footer>
  </main>
</AppShell>
